| `traceability.tests_root` | string | `tests` | a repo-relative directory, no `..`, not reached through a symlink | `scripts/traceability.py` (`scan_tests`); `scripts/pytest_markers.py` | Moves where `make trace` reads marker calls, from the files pytest's own `python_files` rule collects there, entering no directory its `norecursedirs` rule skips. | which files pytest collects: `[tool.pytest.ini_options]` in `pyproject.toml` | always |
